WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.915
Module 5.

00:00:01.915 --> 00:00:03.440
Infrastructure Risk.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.355
Part of Stage 2, Practitioner.

00:00:06.655 --> 00:00:08.918
By the end of this module, you'll

00:00:08.918 --> 00:00:11.381
be able to map every bridge, oracle,

00:00:11.381 --> 00:00:14.210
L2 and contract a position depends on.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:15.565
That's the standard.

00:00:15.565 --> 00:00:17.535
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:18.835 --> 00:00:20.554
There are 8 lessons, starting

00:00:20.554 --> 00:00:22.860
with Bridges and trust assumptions.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.839
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:24.839 --> 00:00:27.110
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.039
If the topic is new to

00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:32.890
you, start with Mastery Starter 5.0.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:34.785
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:34.785 --> 00:00:36.939
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:36.939 --> 00:00:39.070
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:40.877
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:42.910
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.765
Let's begin, with lesson 5.0.
